    "global index": "MMLUPro_engineering_10074",
    "prompt": "Please read the following multiple-choice questions and provide the most likely correct answer based on the options given.\n\nContext: None\n\nQuestion: Let \\textphi = x^2 - y^2 be the potential functions for anirrotational flow. Find the velocity components as functions of x, y, and z.\n\nOptions: \nA. V_x= 2x^2, V_y= -2y^2, V_z= 0\nB. V_x= 2y, V_y= -2x, V_z= 0\nC. V_x= 2x, V_y= -2y, V_z= 0\nD. V_x= x, V_y= y, V_z= z\nE. V_x= 0, V_y= 0, V_z= 0\nF. V_x= 2x, V_y= 2y, V_z= 2z\nG. V_x= x^2, V_y= -y^2, V_z= 2z\nH. V_x= -2x, V_y= 2y, V_z= -z\nI. V_x= 2x, V_y= -2y, V_z= z\nJ. V_x= x, V_y= -y, V_z= 0\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
