      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Empire of Pellucidar}}\n\nDavid Innes and Abner Perry, using resources brought from the surface world, succeeded in building a confederacy of human tribes into what they named the \"Empire of Pellucidar.\" This confederacy was able to defeat the Mahar cities and establish a new human civilization.",
