rg Literary\nArchive Foundation, how to help produce our new eBooks, and how to\nsubscribe to our email newsletter to hear about new eBooks.\n\n\nQuestion: What is Jeremy's fishing rod and line made up of?\n\nProvide your final answer in \\boxed{{}} format. Keep your explanation clear, concise, and within 3 sentences.",
    "prediction": "glm-4-air",
    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "Jeremy's fishing rod is made of a tough stalk of grass, and his line is a fine long white horse-hair. He ties a little wriggling worm at the end of this line for bait. This simple setup is part of his fishing tackle as described in the story. \n\n\\boxed{{a tough stalk of grass and a fine long white horse-hair}}",
