      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{Jacobin Club}\n\nGamelin was described as being fiercely Jacobin, indicating that he was a member of the Jacobin Club, which was a revolutionary group during the French Revolution. The context mentions his adherence to Marat and Robespierre, leaders within the Jacobin Club, further confirming his membership.",
