      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{The women wear burka-like coverings because it is likely a fashion trend or a societal norm in the future setting of the story. The masks and coverings are described as common attire, possibly serving both practical and stylistic purposes. There is no specific mention of a reason related to modesty or religion.}}",
