      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Jerome realizes Theodore is his own son.}}\n\nJerome recognizes a marking below Theodore's shoulder when Theodore removes his shirt to be killed, which identifies Theodore as his son. This recognition occurs during the conversation with Manfred when Jerome is begging for his son's life.",
      "success": true,
