    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{{Mrs. Tittlemouse decides to leave the bees till after dinner, and when she tries to remove the bee nest, three or four other bees put their heads out and buzz fiercely at her.}}\n\nExplanation: Mrs. Tittlemouse encounters resistance from the bees when she attempts to remove the nest; they react aggressively by buzzing fiercely.",
