      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{G}\n\nA sympathetic reader would most likely support respecting Indian territory and sovereignty, as Logan's Address highlights the injustice and brutality faced by his people due to encroachment and violence by white settlers. This sentiment would align with an ethical stance that recognizes the rights of indigenous peoples to their land and autonomy.",
