      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{D}\n\nThe expectations expressed in Article 1 of Source 1 are about the unification of the provinces of Venezuela and New Granada into a single Republic for greater prosperity and power. The sectionalism of elites (Option D) would most undermine these expectations because it would likely lead to division and weaken the unity necessary for the newly formed Republic of Colombia to achieve the stated goals.",
