    "generated_result": {
      "generated_answer": "\\boxed{D}\n\nKennedy's statement reflects American confidence in a time of prosperity as it emphasizes leading in space exploration and achieving difficult goals for the sake of progress and national pride, rather than focusing on fears, critiques, or concerns listed in the other options.",
