able to handle every sort of weapon well on foot and on horse\nB. Expertise with multiple languages\nC. Guarding against getting the name of a liar or a boaster\nD. Being strong and attractive\nE. Musical proficiency and ability to read notes\nF. Familiarity with the poets, orators, and historians\nG. Being bold, strong, and loyal to whomsoever he serves\nH. Ability to write poetry and prose\nI. Expertise with many kinds of weapons\nJ. Being well built, shapely of limb, and showing strength and lightness\n\n\nProvide the correct letter choice in \\boxed{X}, where X is the correct letter choice. Keep the explanation or feedback within 3 sentences.",
